    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64583" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰκᾰρ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>happiness, bliss</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1232p.70V.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενὴ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Herm.</u>
					71
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nav.</u>
				12
			</span></i>: hence, as a Com. euphem. for 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς κόρακας, ἄπαγ᾽ ἐς μακαρίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					1151
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλλ᾽ ἐς μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
					293a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς μ. τὸ λουτρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					245
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>foolishness, nonsense</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεναὶ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Cael.</u>
					140.31
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρῶμα ἐκ ζωμοῦ καὶ
				ἀλφίτων</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
